# The network driver: the virtio shape the block driver has -- register
# windows, eight ring pages, the DMA window, the interrupt and its
# notification -- plus the two 16-page rings frames cross to bin/ipd
# through, and the inbox that wakes it when frames come back.
package netd
version 0.1.0

program bin/netd
entry hertz
cap device-registers
cap memory pages=8
cap dma-window
cap interrupt
cap notification
cap memory pages=16
cap memory pages=16
cap notification

payload bin/netd from user/netd/target/x86_64-unknown-none/release/netd
